test_gate_s4e_donewhen_runs_the_whole_criterion__w	^(macro spitbol|snobol4dotnet|snobol4jvm) version [0-9][0-9.a-z]*$	R-1344 ORACLE-IDENTITY (R-1907; seat dotnet 2026-11-17): the listing page's version line names the engine, "macro spitbol version 4.0f" under sbl -bf, "snobol4dotnet version 0.1" or "snobol4jvm version 0.2.0" under a port, each keeping its own name; read only when an engine prints the page, which SCRIP does not
